flowchart LR
  CI[Check-in] --> CON[Consultation]
  CON --> TX[Treatment Plan]
  TX --> DX[Diagnostics]
  TX --> ORT[Ortho optional]
  TX --> PAY[Payment Step]
  PAY --> RR[Review Request]
  RR --> OUT[Checkout]
  PAY -.->|writes| BILL[(billings + items + payments)]
  PAY -.->|consumes| INV[(inventory)]
  DX -.->|writes| DXO[(diagnostic_orders)]
  ORT -.->|writes| ORTHO[(ortho cases + payments)]
